    "alias_union_rule": "ALIAS UNION (DECISIONS D31 opt (a1) + TASK_877): each requested/recorded symbol resolves to EVERY assets row whose NORMALIZED spelling matches (slash-stripped, upper-cased, plus the known Kraken ticker-alias fold XBT->BTC / XDG->DOGE \u2014 see mcts_trader.data.asset_aliases.normalize_symbol_key; token-exact, never a blanket substring replace), and the group's ohlcv rows are unioned into the slot's single series at load time (NO DB writes \u2014 the ingest identity split is repaired at the loader). Where aliased series overlap in time the closes must AGREE (rel <= 1e-12) or the load REFUSES, naming both asset_ids and the first disagreeing timestamp \u2014 never average, never prefer silently; agreeing duplicate timestamps dedupe. EVIDENCE FLOOR (TASK_877, fail-CLOSED): agreement over an EMPTY overlap is silence, not evidence, so a pair that really blends two feeds (both ids carry rows) and cannot show at least asset_aliases.MIN_ALIAS_OVERLAP_TS = 64 agreeing shared timestamps \u2014 in this window or across its whole history \u2014 REFUSES too (AliasInsufficientOverlapError, naming both ids and the count) instead of unioning on an untested identity; an empty-stub pair (one id with no rows at all) is a pure relabel and is exempt. A PASS means 'no contradiction found', never 'proven the same instrument' \u2014 agreement is necessary, not sufficient. Per-slot usage is disclosed (asset_ids / db_symbols / per_id_rows / overlap_agreement, the last now carrying the per-pair evidence basis).",
    "open_gate_rule": "CAUSAL OPEN-GATE (DECISIONS D31 opt (a2)): a decision cell whose slot printed NO real close anywhere inside its feature bar is force-HELD (the shipped price_valid force-HOLD mechanic), on the pinned AND canon unpinned minute loaders uniformly. The mask is CAUSAL by construction \u2014 bar r's value reads only prints inside bar r, so the mask at decision t is identical whether or not rows after t exist (no look-ahead into whether a gap later resumes; that is also why TRAILING gaps are gated \u2014 at decision time a delisting and an interior hole are indistinguishable). WHAT THE FORCE-HOLD COVERS, stated exactly (regression-panel amendment): the channel holds the WHOLE action, not only the open \u2014 on a masked cell no position can OPEN and none can CLOSE or rebalance either, so a book already holding the slot is CARRIED through the frozen span at the D30 forward-filled valuation (PV-exact to the cent \u2014 the PV-conservation smoke leg, both books, mask ON) and realizes its PnL at the NEXT REAL print. That is the sound semantics, not an oversight: a close at a frozen price would realize PnL against a price no market offered \u2014 the same fabrication class the mask exists to remove \u2014 and a state-aware close-at-the-boundary channel is D30 opt (ii) TRUE LIQUIDATION, which the ruling keeps PARKED. 'The mask only gates OPENING' in the task text is the contrast with VALUATION (the fill still values every row), not a claim that closes execute on frozen cells. Conservative by construction: a masked cell cannot trade, so it can only reduce measured performance, never flatter it.",
